
       IDENTIFICATION   DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.      caller.
       PROCEDURE        DIVISION.
           CALL "callee1" ON EXCEPTION
              CALL "callee2" ON EXCEPTION
                  DISPLAY "neither calee1 nor callee2 found"
              END-CALL
           END-CALL
           GOBACK.


       IDENTIFICATION   DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.      callee2.
       PROCEDURE        DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "this is callee2" NO ADVANCING
           GOBACK.